sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as Python SDK Client
    participant API as API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow<br/>Controller
    participant Driver as Driver Sidecar
    participant Launcher as Launcher v2<br/>Init Container
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant Cache as Cache Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SDK,Cache: Flow 1: Pipeline Submission and Execution

    SDK->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Auth: Bearer Token, Configurable TLS
    API->>MySQL: Store pipeline definition<br/>MySQL protocol, Secret auth
    API->>S3: Store pipeline artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, AWS credentials
    API->>K8s: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    K8s->>Argo: Workflow watch event<br/>TLS, ServiceAccount
    Argo->>K8s: Create pipeline step pod<br/>(with driver + launcher)

    Note over Driver,Launcher: V2 Engine executes within step pod

    Driver->>K8s: Resolve inputs, patch pod spec<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, AWS credentials
    Launcher->>Launcher: Invoke Python executor
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, AWS credentials
    Launcher->>MLMD: Write execution metadata<br/>gRPC, No auth

    Note over PA,API: Flow 2: Run Status Synchronization

    PA->>K8s: Watch Workflow status changes<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>PA: Workflow status update
    PA->>API: Report run state<br/>HTTP 8888/TCP, Projected SA token

    Note over K8s,Cache: Flow 3: Pipeline Step Caching

    K8s->>Cache: Pod admission webhook<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS
    Cache->>MySQL: Check cache fingerprint<br/>MySQL protocol, Secret auth
    Cache-->>K8s: Mutate pod (cache hit/miss)
